 So let's start by taking a look at the client.

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:18.120 align:start position:0%
 And that powerful, as Andy Grove called it,

00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:21.000 align:start position:0%
 the ultimate Darwinian device that

