 I like to think of the AI PC like the Centrino moment.

00:08:31.920 --> 00:08:35.520 align:start position:0%
 Now, when I say that, if you know what that means, OK,

00:08:35.520 --> 00:08:37.520 align:start position:0%
 thank you, humor me.

00:08:37.520 --> 00:08:39.200 align:start position:0%
 And I've been around for a while.

