00:11:03.360 --> 00:11:05.680 align:start position:0%
 And later in the keynote, we'll give you some examples

00:11:05.680 --> 00:11:07.400 align:start position:0%
 of those use cases.

00:11:07.400 --> 00:11:10.200 align:start position:0%
 And you need to capitalize on this opportunity.

00:11:10.200 --> 00:11:11.760 align:start position:0%
 You need to refresh.

00:11:11.760 --> 00:11:14.000 align:start position:0%
 You know, on things like office productivity alone,

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:17.520 align:start position:0%
 almost a 50% improvement over a three-year-old PC.

00:11:17.520 --> 00:11:20.000 align:start position:0%
 And most of you have four and five-year-old PCs.

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:23.840 align:start position:0%
 Time to upgrade, you know, battery life, new four-factor

00:11:23.840 --> 00:11:26.760 align:start position:0%
