00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:42.160 align:start position:0%
 Every application is going through an AI makeover.

00:11:42.160 --> 00:11:45.720 align:start position:0%
 And without Intel Core Ultra, you're going to miss out.

00:11:45.720 --> 00:11:47.880 align:start position:0%
 Simply put, time to refresh.

