 But then you're combining it with real-time data

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:56.800 align:start position:0%
 coming through your vector databases, your streaming,

00:16:56.800 --> 00:16:58.960 align:start position:0%
 unstructured databases as well.

00:16:58.960 --> 00:17:02.480 align:start position:0%
 And bringing both of those together in real time,

00:17:02.480 --> 00:17:05.200 align:start position:0%
