 One, ambiguous value realization.

00:26:29.720 --> 00:26:30.720 align:start position:0%
 OK.

00:26:30.720 --> 00:26:33.040 align:start position:0%
 Many clients are telling me it's really hard

00:26:33.040 --> 00:26:35.920 align:start position:0%
 to realize value from their AI investment.

00:26:35.920 --> 00:26:40.560 align:start position:0%
 And that's even with very well-defined AI KPIs, metrics,

00:26:40.560 --> 00:26:41.760 align:start position:0%
