 associating AI KPIs to the task level.

00:26:50.640 --> 00:26:54.960 align:start position:0%
 So having this kind of a task oriented task-centric approach,

00:26:54.960 --> 00:26:58.240 align:start position:0%
 you're missing out a lot of aggregate value

