00:27:42.400 --> 00:27:44.240 align:start position:0%
 For some progressive companies who

00:27:44.240 --> 00:27:48.400 align:start position:0%
 are also trying to fine tune or pre-train their own models,

00:27:48.400 --> 00:27:54.640 align:start position:0%
