00:27:54.640 --> 00:27:55.480 align:start position:0%
 data.

00:27:55.480 --> 00:27:57.400 align:start position:0%
 So let me give you one example.

00:27:57.400 --> 00:28:01.000 align:start position:0%
 Since Accenture does so much work in context and AI.

