00:28:08.760 --> 00:28:09.520 align:start position:0%
 37 standard.

00:28:09.520 --> 00:28:11.760 align:start position:0%
 One single version of it's true.

00:28:11.760 --> 00:28:15.080 align:start position:0%
 So the third challenge is widened talent gaps.

00:28:15.080 --> 00:28:17.920 align:start position:0%
