00:55:03.880 --> 00:55:07.680 align:start position:0%
 So here's one way we are using generative AI in the fab.

00:55:07.680 --> 00:55:10.480 align:start position:0%
 One of our goals is to keep our equipment up

00:55:10.480 --> 00:55:12.360 align:start position:0%
