00:56:12.040 --> 00:56:14.920 align:start position:0%
 So let's suppose you have an incident on some equipment.

00:56:14.920 --> 00:56:17.720 align:start position:0%
 You can come here and use natural language

00:56:17.720 --> 00:56:18.800 align:start position:0%
 to search for the incident.

00:56:19.800 --> 00:56:22.600 align:start position:0%
 So here I'm typing an example.

00:56:24.600 --> 00:56:27.800 align:start position:0%
 So on the right, you can see relevant past events

00:56:27.800 --> 00:56:30.800 align:start position:0%
 that are similar based on the semantic search performed.

00:56:30.800 --> 00:56:32.600 align:start position:0%
 And on the left, the AI assistant

00:56:32.600 --> 00:56:34.800 align:start position:0%
 has generated the most likely root cause

00:56:34.800 --> 00:56:38.800 align:start position:0%
 and resolution for the incident based on historical data.

00:56:38.800 --> 00:56:41.600 align:start position:0%
 You can also summarize the steps performed

00:56:41.600 --> 00:56:43.600 align:start position:0%
 to address a root cause.

00:56:43.600 --> 00:56:48.600 align:start position:0%
 So here you see the work orders that contain those steps.

00:56:52.600 --> 00:56:55.600 align:start position:0%
 And you can identify unique tasks.

